rew of angry gnomes has come a long way.And to celebrate, we're part of Steam Next Fest! Grab the demo, round up your crew, and show the islands who's boss. We'll be watching every clip, review and piece of feedback you send our way.What's Coming in the Full ReleaseThe demo is only a t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:18:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693541","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900890-1845383656388074","game_id":"steam-4900890","kind":"announcement","title":"v1.3.7 - New features & Bug fixes!","summary":"Hey gnomes! It's been a while since our last devlog, which was for v1.2.5. Since then v1.3.7 is out, and here are the changes:NewHarbour Sheriff: hire him to fight for your crew and sell him your lootFlintlock pistol: sold in some harbours; some pirate captains now shoot from the helmPlinko machine in harboursCustomization rework: new hats and hair, colours, and unlockable hats (Octopus Hat, Outlaw Hat)Room namesBrightness setting (night only)Now you can press E to load a cannonball into a canno","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T00:21:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900890-1844751498222976","game_id":"steam-4900890","kind":"announcement","title":"v1.2.5 - New features & Bug fixes!","summary":"A new update is here! We've added new areas, weapons, customization options, and a bunch of improvements.- New ChunksPiranha WatersBandit Camp- New WeaponsBlowpipeSpear- MapThe map now shows the locations of players and islands, making it easier to navigate the world and find your crew.- New ResourcesNew ore typesNew scrap types- Customize Your GnomeYou can now change the color of your gnome however you likeNew Female gnome- ImprovementsPerformance optimizationsFixed a bunch of physics bugsVario","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T00:32:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222976","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900890-1844751498217721","game_id":"steam-4900890","kind":"announcement","title":"Over 10,000 Wishlists!","summary":"We've gathered over 10,000 wishlists in just 5 days! 🤯 We've been listening to everything you guys are saying in our Discord, discord.gg/grrgrrgnomes. and we've already fixed a ton of bugs, from ships randomly flying off into different galaxies to coconuts completely glitching out players. With Steam Next Fest getting closer, we're putting all the time we have into making the game feel better, play better, and fixing as much chaos as possible! Thank you to everyone who's been playing, reporting ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T08:15:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217721","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900890-1844115010497568","game_id":"steam-4900890","kind":"announcement","title":"1,000 Wishlists — Thank You, Gnomes","summary":"800 gnomes at sea. 1,000 wishlists. Two days. We shipped the demo expecting a few dozen people to drown politely. Instead: 800 concurrent players at peak. Over 1,000 wishlists. For a two-person team that spent the last stretch arguing about whether the kraken should be bigger, this is genuinely absurd. Thank you. We're patching the demo based on your feedback, and there's more coming before launch — the islands go deeper than the beaches you've seen so far. If you haven't wishlisted yet, that's ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T17:39:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497568","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4900890-1844115010496304","game_id":"steam-4900890","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO RELEASED!!","summary":"Welcome aboard you little gnome! 🧙‍♂️As you know this game is fully physics-based. That means gnomes will fly, flip, bounce, and ragdoll in ways that we never intended. We fixed a LOT of bugs during testing... but let's be honest, we definitely missed some. (Probably a lot)So if you see an item clipping through the floor, launching into orbit, or achieving forbidden physics please screenshot it, clip it, and come tell us on Discord. You'll be doing your civic gnome duty.https://discord.gg/grrgrr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T23:47:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4900890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4900890":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4900890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z"},"5214090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:13:57Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_ve